WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.372
Falconer's problem, every dimension.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.467
A fractal dust of points. Over half-dimensional?

3
00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:07.934
Then its distances should fill an interval.

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.278
Scale by scale, a two-depth potential pays

5
00:00:11.278 --> 00:00:13.230
for every step of the recursion.

6
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.166
Claimed: half the dimension suffices, everywhere.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.327
Main theorem Lean-checked.
